Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:39.58,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:55.42,def2,TSUBASA,0,0,0,,Falcon !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:57.78,def2,TSUBASA,0,0,0,,Here, this’s my daddy’s Falcon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:02:02.24,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tsubasa, but will\N you be okay if I keep this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.84,0:02:04.00,def2,TSUBASA,0,0,0,,No, I'm not !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:27.70,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Oh no, the Yamato crew has rebelled…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:32.26,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I've been summoned by the security bureau.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:36.28,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Did you know ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:37.92,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:45.14,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,They must've been worried about me,\N but I feel like I was left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:57.52,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Only me. Only me…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:11.12,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,This is the flagship Andromeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:18.42,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Deploy the Aldebaran, Apollo Norm, Achilles, Antares, and the Class-Ds on both wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:20.98,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Launch fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:38.76,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,All ships, take multi-tier formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:51.74,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Each ship, eliminate the target in each \Ncorresponding area within ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:03:58.78,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,All ships, begin firing cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:17.82,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, it's unusual for that\N many ships to be built in only three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:22.84,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Time Fault…? Could it be real ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:25.28,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:29.02,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,The Yamato took off even \Nthough it was an act of rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:31.23,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:34.44,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,We can't turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:39.94,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Well then, we'd better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:50.88,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,There were deserters from the fleet which\N was conducting exercises in Jupiter's orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:55.73,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,If we allow one exception,\N everything will fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:57.14,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,That's what this is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:00.03,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,I’ll secure the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:03.16,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,...no matter what the outcome will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:05.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Pursuit team, move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:14.28,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Deputy Commander, how many of the former Yamato squadron pilots are participating in this exercise ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.28,0:05:16.73,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,There were eight, all of whom {all}deserted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:20.12,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,However, thirty of their students are\N still participating in the exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:24.54,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,There's a possibility of rebellion. \NBring all thirty of them to this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:26.56,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:31.46,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,We've been ordered to hunt for the \Nbig one those rats are heading to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:42.10,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,We’re getting closer to the asteroid belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:46.60,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,I know this is for camouflage, but it's \Ndangerous without the wave motion shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:50.30,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,We have to bear with it until the warp drive is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:56.74,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,I’m afraid that it will take another five hours until the wave motion coil is replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:06:00.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We're in the Defense Force's front \Nyard until we leave the Solar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Get yourself ready and focus on surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:03.52,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:07.34,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Analyzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:08.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Yes ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:11.08,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Can you access Niimi's personal file ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:12.68,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:16.52,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Good. Search for the term “Izumo Plan.”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.42,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:41.90,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,You said you saw a vision, Sabu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:46.32,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,If so, you must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:48.98,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Makoto…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:55.02,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Why is the Yamato flying again ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.88,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,What's with them all of a sudden ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:02.26,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Takuma, watch your six and evade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:03.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:07.56,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Damn, we're both Earthlings…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:13.40,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,I think I know why the Yamato’s flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:18.30,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,It must be our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:19.64,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,For what ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:25.66,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,{iskandar}We were glad when Iscandar offered to help, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:30.98,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,{tasuke}We heard the voice of someone asking for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:34.02,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,This time, it's our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.60,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,{dakara}That’s why the Yamato’s flying…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:43.30,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,{sorewa}…according to the set order, don’t you think so ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:49.48,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,{ano}We did our best during the last war.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:54.23,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,{kekka}Nobody knew what the outcome would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.23,0:07:56.54,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,It didn’t matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.98,0:08:02.94,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,{watashi}Both Sabu and I are living our lives honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:06.40,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,{tsubasa}That’s all I want to tell Tsubasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:10.92,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,{kakko}So, be a cool dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:16.60,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,{tsubasa}…for Tsubasa's sake…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:24.98,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,…and for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:27.88,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Makoto…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.40,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Go to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:00.90,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What the hell was that ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:05.82,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,A powerful electro-magnetic pulse…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:09.88,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,We can’t ID friend or foe. Why…?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:12.12,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You can only use your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:14.14,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Who is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:16.10,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Pilot skills will make the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:18.43,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.43,0:09:21.98,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,If missiles and radar are useless, \NI can outdo them with my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:32.18,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Good. You've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:36.02,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Garmillas…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:43.98,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,As I told you before, Garmillas owes the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:49.52,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,The Yamato has left Earth once again on a lonely journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:53.58,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,This time, it’s our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:58.38,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Ambassador Barrel, Earth has its own way of doing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:10:00.63,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.63,0:10:03.20,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,...I'm following our principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:11.16,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Rebellion, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:18.40,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Those who've been to Iscandar \Nseem to be detached from reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:29.48,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,This ship will commence pursuit by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:33.06,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,The target is the insurgent ship Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:11.30,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,We're lucky this section wasn't part of the refit.{modification.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:12.62,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:18.22,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,But are those remains of the Izumo Plan really useful ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:23.50,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Spacecraft detected approaching\N from the upper starboard side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:24.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.06,0:11:29.40,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Some of them are identified. \NIt's the space fighter/attacker Cosmo Tiger II.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:37.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I forbid opening fire until I give the order. \NDon't start the fight from our side.{shoot from our side.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:38.74,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Fifteen seconds until contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:11:59.36,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Spacecraft code identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:03.80,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,They're the Yamamoto team \Nfrom the Moon Space Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:07.84,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Open the hatch and bring the Cosmo Tiger team in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:09.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:11.12,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,They came.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.02,0:12:15.96,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yay  !{optional}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:19.56,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.56,0:12:20.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It’s been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:23.06,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,That Garmillas spacecraft that joined us…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:26.52,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yeah, it’s from the Embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:43.04,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Junior Grade Keyman, \Nwhat's the meaning of this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:48.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,As I said, I wish to be on the Yamato as an adviser.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:54.46,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The journey to Telezart is unprecedented, but the knowledge of Garmillas will become useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:56.46,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,If so, only a route map and…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:59.36,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I insist on remaining aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:07.23,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Why not, Acting Captain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:08.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,We are short-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Hey, Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:14.18,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Ship detected at 12 o’clock. \NRapidly closing in at 32 S-knot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:17.78,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Range, 0.7 light seconds. 130 until contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.34,0:13:20.06,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,It's the Andromeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:21.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Wave motion shield ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:23.36,def2,ENOMOTO,0,0,0,,Replacing the last circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:25.78,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Message from the Andromeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:27.40,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,On the main panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:34.46,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}So, the dead souls are leading you to where ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:38.92,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Acting Captain Kodai, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:44.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,There's a chance a serious \Ncrisis is about to break out in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:50.62,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}What if it can't be stopped by the Yamato alone ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:13:54.48,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:58.38,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You have to face{be backed by} reality first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:14:00.76,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,By a reality that leads to a wrong future ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:18.98,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,I'll say it one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:20.98,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:25.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:29.24,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}What a shame…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:32.22,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,They’re coming !\N Class-1 battle stations !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:36.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Shima, set course for the asteroid belt and go in.{enter it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:37.94,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Go in ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:39.62,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,But the wave motion shield is still…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.58,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Hurry. I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.48,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Distance to the Andromeda is 0.3 light seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:49.22,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Launch a preemptive strike.\N Get the graviton spread ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:51.82,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Target the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:53.94,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:04.70,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,The asteroids ahead have vanished !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:07.12,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Calm down. It's out of range.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:10.54,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Side depth-charge launcher, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:11.20,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:31.14,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Emit magnetron wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:40.53,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Target acquired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:42.04,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.22,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,All on target.{Perfect hit.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:05.04,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What is that ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.06,0:16:12.62,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Asteroid ship…\NWhat an antique trick…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:20.68,def2,ENOMOTO,0,0,0,,Chief Engineer, hold for one minute !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:23.66,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Release camouflage !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:34.90,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Maximize electromagnetic induction. \NRotate rapidly for ship defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:36.68,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Start rotating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:02.18,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Rock volume decreased to 50%.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:05.16,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Please hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:07.62,def2,test,0,0,0,,Rock volume 30%.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:11.78,def2,ENOMOTO,0,0,0,,This is Enomoto. Everything's done.{ready.}{Work’s done.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:13.94,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Close the electromagnetic induction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:16.34,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Concentrate wave motion shield at the bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:23.74,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Contact with the Andromeda in ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.88,def2,BOTH,0,0,0,,{\pos(468,1048)}Prepare for impact !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.88,def2,BOTH,0,0,0,,{\pos(1310,1042)\c&HEEEDB8&}Prepare for impact !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:08.98,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,What a stubborn lad your son is, Mr. Okita.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:22.92,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Captain, should we turn and pursue ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:26.76,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Captain !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:29.44,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Emergency message from HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:30.44,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,On screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.80,0:18:39.02,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}HQ has a directive to all Earth ships in the Solar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:42.14,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Terminate pursuit of the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.34,0:18:50.04,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The treason charge against the\N Yamato crew has been dropped.{is cleared.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:55.50,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I repeat. The treason charge against \Nthe Yamato crew has been dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.26,0:18:58.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:02.54,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I did say we were useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:07.68,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,I appreciate this, Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:10.04,def2,MINISTER,0,0,0,,Are you satisfied ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.64,0:19:18.90,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,The Time Fault will not only change the \Nfuture of Earth, but of Garmillas, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:25.26,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,If we corner those who've\N gained knowledge of it…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:31.46,def2,MINISTER,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that the secret was \Nleaked by the Garmillas embassy staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:36.64,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,If that's true, it's a terrible thing.\N We'll launch a thorough investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:46.00,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Anyhow, no charges against the Yamato’s rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:52.82,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,HQ retroactively approved the Yamato’s expedition to Telezart as an independent task force.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:55.56,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{toiu}And you’re fine with that, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.08,0:19:58.90,def2,MINISTER,0,0,0,,Exactly as you planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:06.18,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}To the Yamato crew, as the Chief,\N I issue you new orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:13.40,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Get to the bottom of the imminent crisis, and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:16.63,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{buji}…return home safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:17.46,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&} That'll be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:21.60,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I handed it over to them according to your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:26.24,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,All of them requested transfer to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:29.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,You anticipated this outcome, Captain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:36.76,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,I was going to use them as hostages if the\N situation called for it, so this just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:43.23,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is Kato Saburo, \Nformer Yamato squadron commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.23,0:21:44.64,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&} Request permission to come aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:45.36,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Kato !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:47.36,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Kato’s here !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.48,0:21:55.12,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Tsubasa, this is the Yamato. Your dad’s ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:21:59.46,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,I wish I could let you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:44.63,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(212,874)}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:44.63,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(362,1046)}Face off ! Yamato vs Andromeda
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:23:05.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Tawamureru yuragu tsuki no kagami
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:23:05.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The reflection of the moon is blurry and capricious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:17.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kokoro tokasu yuubina kami no itazura
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:17.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Graceful God's mischief mesmerizes my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:28.66,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchi ni himeta awai omoide ni
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:28.66,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}There's a faint memory hidden within{inside}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:41.14,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Iki wo fukikomu no michite yukumade
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:41.14,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Breathe life into it until it's full
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.14,0:23:52.92,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hibiku anata no mune no kodou wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.14,0:23:52.92,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I hear a heartbeat echoing through
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:24:03.08,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Watashi hitori janai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:24:03.08,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I am not alone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.34,0:24:14.98,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Saewataru sora ni inori
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.34,0:24:14.98,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I pray to the wide open sky
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.74,0:24:39.00,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Atarashii ichinichi no maku ga aketeyuku
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.74,0:24:39.00,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The curtain opens on a brand new day
