Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.13,0:24:55.58,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.14,0:24:58.20,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,The size of the enemy is too large \Nfor the Yamato to handle by itself.{The scale of the enemy is too large \Nfor the Yamato to handle alone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:25:01.06,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,I find it contradictory that we'd abandon \Ndrowning people right before our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.06,0:25:01.88,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,That’s too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.88,0:25:05.52,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The Yamato currently has a serious weakness.\N You should know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.52,0:25:08.42,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Commence the 11th planet rescue operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.13,0:25:09.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 06
